title: "Azad Bilik open data"
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24543369
version: "1.6"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
authors:
  - name: "Azad Bilik contributors"
    website: "https://azadbilik.org"
abstract: >-
  Open data about Azerbaijani culture and its geography. Culture: the catalogue of the
  Kitabxana.az library of Azerbaijani literature and the Azad Bilik gallery's index of miniatures
  by scene and chapter. Atlas: census populations of historical Azerbaijan by district and county,
  Azerbaijani communities in Georgia, Dagestan and Soviet Armenia, the peoples of Azerbaijan
  by district, native languages by uezd at the 1897 census, and the raions of the Azerbaijan SSR
  at the censuses of 1926–1989. Every figure carries its source.
keywords: [Azerbaijan, Azerbaijani literature, Nizami, miniatures, census, population, minorities, languages, 1897 census, Soviet census, open data]
license: CC0-1.0
